ParentVault_cancelDeposit
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
├── when caller has no deposit
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoDeposit
└── when the cancel deposit is valid
    ├── it should transfer USDC from the vault to the depositor
    ├── it should delete the depositor's deposit mapping
    ├── it should update the epoch total deposit amount
    └── it should emit DepositCancelled
